MODIFICATIONS
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

In accordance with Section 4(b) of the Apache License 2.0, the following
files have been modified by the MaxCloner project relative to upstream:

  Bcore/src/main/cpp/Utils/AntiDetection.cpp
      Added the rebranded host package data directory to the list of paths
      hidden from sandboxed applications.

  Bcore/src/main/java/top/niunaijun/blackbox/core/env/BEnvironment.java
      Added per-package split APK storage directory and lookup helpers.

  Bcore/src/main/java/top/niunaijun/blackbox/core/system/pm/installer/CopyExecutor.java
      Added split APK (Android App Bundle) installation, and native library
      extraction from split APKs in addition to the base APK.

  Bcore/src/main/java/top/niunaijun/blackbox/core/system/pm/PackageManagerCompat.java
      Populates ApplicationInfo.splitSourceDirs / splitPublicSourceDirs for
      cloned bundle applications.

  Bcore/src/main/java/top/niunaijun/blackbox/app/BActivityThread.java
      Class loader now includes split APKs on the dex path and is given an
      explicit native library search path.

  Bcore/src/main/java/top/niunaijun/blackbox/app/configuration/ClientConfiguration.java
      getLogSenderChatId() now returns null instead of a hardcoded upstream
      Telegram chat id, disabling automatic upload of device logs to a
      third party.

  app/src/main/res/xml/setting.xml
      Removed the "Send Logs" preference, which uploaded logs to the
      upstream project rather than to the operator of this build.

  app/build.gradle
      Application id, release signing configuration, APK output naming.

  app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml
      Application display name.

  gradle.properties, gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.properties
      Build memory, network timeout and IPv4 stack settings.

Full technical rationale for each change is documented in MAXCLONER.md.
